s but we've seen other  actors deny these claims before  only to end up actually playing the  roles that they denied they were going  to play  so there's a high chance that she  actually is going to be playing jennifer  walters and she hulk  then we have moon knight which is kind  of starting to gear up the latest  reports say that oscar isaac is  currently in negotiations with marvel  studios right now to play mark spector  aka moon knight now these three shows  coming in phase five is a really good  thing because all of these three shows  are going to introduce new characters  and while we are definitely very very  excited for marvel's phase four disney  plus shows  they are based on existing characters  wanda vision  sam and bucky hawkeye loki and of course  they'll be introducing some new side  characters as well and there's a ton of  hype and excitement around these shows  right now but phase five is going to  need some new characters which we are  getting with these three shows  now another disney plus show that has  been officially confirmed is the show  that's going to  revolve around nick fury we're not  exactly sure what the title of this  disney plus show is going to be yet but  sam jackson is confirmed to be returning  to reprise his role as nick fury  and that's it for the confirmed shows  that we have so far for marvel's phase 5  now to get on to the confirmed movies  now when it comes to a new  phase a new slate of films you have to  have sequels to films that we've seen in  previous phases  but of course they can't all be sequels  otherwise the hype  isn't exactly as big as it could be but  with the new projects that marvel has  coming there is definitely no shortage  of hype  to start it off just a couple of weeks  ago it was confirmed that  deadpool is currently in development now  ryan reynolds told us basically a year  ago  that deadpool was now over at marvel  studios and that they were working on  the film already  but now it has been officially confirmed  that marvel studios has hired the  mollino  sisters along with ryan reynolds himself  to write the new deadpool 3.  this puts it on track for a phase 5  release a recent rumor going around  states that deadpool 3 is actually going  to take place  during the events of avengers infinity  war and avengers in game and we'll see  what deadpool was up to the whole entire  time behind the scenes of what the  avengers were doing then we have  blade blade was officially announced at  2019  san diego comic-con by kevin feige of  course mahershala ali has been cast as  blade and recently marvel has hired  writers for the series as well  everyone is really excited for blade  because not only is blade an awesome  character but his movie is said to be  introducing the  monster verse to the mcu the monster  verse will include characters like  dracula the punisher doctor strange  basically the entire group of the  midnight  suns so fans are not only really excited  about the movie itself  but also the new side of the mcu that  it's going to introduce  then we have one of the projects that a  lot of people cannot wait to finally see  happen in phase 5 and that is the  fantastic  four kevin feige also announced the  fantastic four  in 2019 at san diego comic-con now as of  right now we haven't heard anything  official as far as casting is concerned  or as far as hiring writers and  directors are concerned however  there has been a ton of talk from the  fan base stating that they would love to  have  john krasinski playing mr fantastic reed  richards  and his wife in real life emily blunt to  play sue storm  slash the invisible woman now a lot of  people think that these two would be  perfect for these specific roles and  what's really interesting is  many people have said for a while that  disney and marvel doesn't listen to fan  casts  however it was recently revealed that  rosario dawson who plays ahsoka in the  mandalorian  was chosen for the role because of the  fan 